WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.812
We sat outside on the steps.

2
00:00:15.813 --> 00:00:19.087
Molly put her chin in her hands.

3
00:00:19.088 --> 00:00:21.368
"I don't want to give Tufty away.

4
00:00:21.369 --> 00:00:25.405
But I don't think he's going to learn to talk."

5
00:00:25.406 --> 00:00:30.466
"Don't worry," I said. "I'll think of something else."

6
00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:35.823
Molly smiled. She felt better, but I felt worried.

7
00:00:35.824 --> 00:00:39.528
How could I keep Tufty from making noise?

8
00:00:39.529 --> 00:00:48.573
Just then we heard the scream of a fire engine siren from Molly's apartment!

9
00:00:48.574 --> 00:00:53.454
"Oh no! Tufty's doing it again!" cried Molly.

10
00:00:53.455 --> 00:00:57.180
"I hope the fire department doesn't hear him," said Josh.

11
00:00:57.181 --> 00:01:00.787
"They'll think there's a real fire somewhere!"

12
00:01:00.788 --> 00:01:05.226
On the sidewalk two boys were squirting each other with a hose.

13
00:01:05.227 --> 00:01:08.994
They squirted some water on us.

14
00:01:08.995 --> 00:01:13.285
"That feels nice and cool!" said Jenny.

15
00:01:13.286 --> 00:01:17.539
"Just like at the movies," I said.

16
00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:20.572
Mrs. Carroll came outside.

17
00:01:20.573 --> 00:01:24.160
She was carrying a box of old DVDs.

18
00:01:24.161 --> 00:01:28.422
The word "Free" was written on the box.

19
00:01:28.423 --> 00:01:31.850
"I'm giving these away," she told us.

20
00:01:31.851 --> 00:01:34.393
"You kids can have them, if you'd like.

21
00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.043
My son is grown up now.

22
00:01:36.044 --> 00:01:39.286
He doesn't watch them anymore."

23
00:01:39.287 --> 00:01:43.842
We took the DVDs from her and looked at them.

24
00:01:43.843 --> 00:01:48.302
"It's The Magic Music Box!" said Jenny.

25
00:01:48.303 --> 00:01:50.974
"I love that movie."

26
00:01:50.975 --> 00:01:54.769
"It has a lot of great songs in it," said Molly.

27
00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:56.157
Beep! Beep!

28
00:01:56.158 --> 00:02:01.197
From Molly's apartment came the sound of a taxi honking.

29
00:02:01.198 --> 00:02:05.240
"There goes Tufty again!" said Caswell.

30
00:02:05.241 --> 00:02:08.702
Suddenly I got an idea.

31
00:02:08.703 --> 00:02:14.213
"Maybe The Magic Music Box will keep Tufty quiet," I said.

32
00:02:14.214 --> 00:02:16.696
"At least until I can think of something else.

33
00:02:16.697 --> 00:02:22.481
We can watch the movie on a computer."

34
00:02:22.482 --> 00:02:25.243
We walked upstairs to my apartment.

35
00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:28.078
On the way we got Tufty.

36
00:02:28.079 --> 00:02:32.468
I asked my mom if I could borrow her spray bottle of water.

37
00:02:32.469 --> 00:02:35.599
She uses it for her plants.

38
00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:39.432
"Now everyone go into my room," I said.

39
00:02:39.433 --> 00:02:44.458
"We're going to watch a movie in an air-conditioned theater!"

40
00:02:44.459 --> 00:02:48.166
"Air-conditioned?" Jenny echoed.

41
00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:53.043
"But Mr. Calabria said we couldn't use air conditioners yet."

42
00:02:53.044 --> 00:02:56.218
"You'll see!" I promised her.

43
00:02:56.219 --> 00:03:00.420
We all squeezed into my bedroom.

44
00:03:00.421 --> 00:03:05.599
"It's crowded in here!" Jenny giggled.

45
00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:10.118
"It's hot too," added Josh.

46
00:03:10.119 --> 00:03:12.191
I turned on my fan.

47
00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:17.755
"Who wants to get cool first?"

48
00:03:17.756 --> 00:03:20.908
"Me!" shouted Caswell.

49
00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:23.819
I turned the fan towards Caswell.

50
00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:28.048
Then, standing behind it, I squirted him with water from the bottle.

51
00:03:28.049 --> 00:03:31.932
The fan sprayed the water all over him!

52
00:03:31.933 --> 00:03:35.918
"That feels good!" cried Caswell.

53
00:03:35.919 --> 00:03:40.431
We took turns using my fan and spraying each other with water.

54
00:03:40.432 --> 00:03:45.039
"Be careful of the computer!" I shouted, laughing.

55
00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:49.045
"And don't get my boot wet!" cried Molly.

56
00:03:49.046 --> 00:03:51.551
The water felt great.

57
00:03:51.552 --> 00:03:54.447
Even Tufty loved it!

58
00:03:54.448 --> 00:03:57.233
Soon we started watching the movie.

59
00:03:57.234 --> 00:03:58.777
Molly was right.

60
00:03:58.778 --> 00:04:02.252
The movie did have lots of great songs.

61
00:04:02.253 --> 00:04:05.250
I really liked "Telephone Number."

62
00:04:05.251 --> 00:04:09.006
You can sing any phone number with that song.

63
00:04:09.007 --> 00:04:12.962
I sang Molly and Caswell's telephone number:

64
00:04:12.963 --> 00:04:13.890
You can sing

65
00:04:13.891 --> 00:04:16.139
And you can sing your number

66
00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:17.620
And put it in a song.

67
00:04:17.621 --> 00:04:19.321
My number is 555...

68
00:04:19.322 --> 00:04:22.251
I never get it wrong!

69
00:04:22.252 --> 00:04:26.593
After the movie was over, we kept singing the song with Molly's number.

70
00:04:26.594 --> 00:04:30.943
We sang over and over while we sprayed each other with water.

71
00:04:30.944 --> 00:04:37.913
We were having so much fun that we forgot all about Tufty.

72
00:04:37.914 --> 00:04:40.453
Suddenly Molly stopped singing.

73
00:04:40.454 --> 00:04:42.593
She looked around.

74
00:04:42.594 --> 00:04:46.085
"Where's Tufty?" she said.

75
00:04:46.086 --> 00:04:50.260
"He was here a minute ago," said Josh.

76
00:04:50.261 --> 00:04:52.252
"He couldn't have flown into the kitchen,"

77
00:04:52.253 --> 00:04:54.896
I said, glancing at my bedroom door.

78
00:04:54.897 --> 00:04:56.994
It was closed.

79
00:04:56.995 --> 00:05:01.009
We looked under my bed and behind my dresser.

80
00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:03.806
But there was no sign of Tufty.

81
00:05:03.807 --> 00:05:06.492
Then Josh pointed upward.

82
00:05:06.493 --> 00:05:13.757
"Iggy, your skylight is open," he said.

83
00:05:13.758 --> 00:05:17.224
Molly's face turned white.

84
00:05:17.225 --> 00:05:25.965
"Oh no!" she cried. "Tufty flew away!"
